nbsp;
</span></span><![endif]>Probe for logical 3G opportunities while going abou=
t UTC promotion keying off existing use of PE tubing in various application=
s.&nbsp;
<i>Recent &#8220;no lead&#8221; movement should improve traction.</i><o:p><=
/o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level=
1 lfo4"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">4.<span style=
=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;
</span></span><![endif]>Develop irrigation business where PE already in use=
 by exposing product to distributors, contractors, consultants, owners.<o:p=
></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level=
