=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;
</span></span><![endif]>Update all price sheets for new configurations.&nbs=
p; <i>Web site has current price sheets and brochures.</i><o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l1 level=
1 lfo4"><![if !supportLists]><span style=3D"mso-list:Ignore">6.<span style=
=3D"font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&=
nbsp;
</span></span><![endif]>Feedback new demand sources so it can be factored i=
nto replenishment.&nbsp;
<i>We were caught by surprise by the SIDR and CTS demand increases.&nbsp; W=
e have the cooperation of Philmac to judiciously air freight to support gro=
wth.</i><o:p></o:p></p>
