</span></span><![endif]>Cepex continues its efforts mostly through &#8220;T=
he Lateral Connection&#8221; in the municipal market and through its own ef=
forts in the irrigation market.<o:p></o:p></p>
<p class=3D"MsoListParagraph" style=3D"text-indent:-.25in;mso-list:l0 level=
