;&nbsp;
</span></span></b><![endif]>Floplast is becoming more aggressive in all mar=
kets with tradeshow activities.<span style=3D"color:#1F497D">&nbsp;
</span><b>They have shown an acme tee at times.<o:p></o:p></b></p>
