Brian Gain called about UTC.  He said he is having a hard time keeping them=
 on the shelves.  Contractors covering "multiple markets" love them.  He me=
ntioned using over 1000 of them in one job, Village of Frankfort meter chan=
ge out.  On the matter of wrench he said they gave the city the same oil fi=
lter wrench we suggested which seems to have satisfied them for the time be=
ing.  Brian looks to have made a specific effort to get them into contracto=
rs and cities hands.  He says business is slowing but not for UTC.


